          "text": "Every day, careless and reckless drivers on the streets of Denver put everyone at risk. Drowsy driving is a dangerous behavior that can increase the odds of broken traffic laws, distracted driving and falling asleep behind the wheel. If you get injured in an accident caused by a drowsy driver, a ",
