            "l4hh"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4hj",
          "text": " states that 693 people died in these collisions in 2022 (the most recent year data is available). Colorado has a high rate of drowsy driving accidents compared to other states. In 2022, ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4hl",
          "text": "Colorado State Troopers",
          "marks": [
            "l4hk"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4hm",
          "text": " reported 84 crashes due to fatigue or a driver falling asleep.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
