          "href": "https://www.sleepfoundation.org/drowsy-driving/drowsy-driving-vs-drunk-driving"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4hq",
          "text": "Driving while tired can slow down a driver’s thought processing speed and affect the ability to concentrate, react in a timely manner to hazards and make sound decisions. The ",
