      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4ib",
          "text": "It only takes a moment of inattention for a drowsy driver to cause a serious car accident. Since reaction times are highly affected by tiredness, drowsy drivers often do not even tap the brakes prior to impact. This increases the severity of these collisions due to high speeds. Fatigue also comes with a risk of catastrophic accidents such as ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s4ie",
          "text": "head-on",
          "marks": [
